If you are invisible and stealthy, they won't even know you're there.
Its really easy just to approach a gaggle (school, pride, pod???) of
wraiths et.al. and whack them one at a time, eating the corpses as you
go.  This is especially useful if you have a blessed tinning kit, and
can save all of the giant corpses for later.  You will easily max out
your experience at 30, and probably gain an additional 100 hit points
or so from eating wraiths after you have hit level 30 (5 hp / wraith).

